# Browser QA artifacts (screenshots, traces, failure contexts). Generated on every run and
# never part of the app; the specs and fixtures under e2e/ are tracked, this output is not.
e2e/.artifacts/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Local agent/tooling config and one-off operational scripts. These are deliberately NOT
# part of the repository. .claude/settings.json in particular has held live credentials
# inlined in its allowed-command list, so an accidental `git add -A` must not be able to
# publish it. Ignoring them enforces that mechanically rather than by remembering.
.claude/
scripts/add-showtime-members.mjs
